## conclusion: unprivileged collection cannot get a pid/writer identity.
## PID attribution requires eBPF (with CAP_BPF/CAP_PERFMON) or the audit
## subsystem (with CAP_AUDIT_WRITE + audit rules installed by root).
## Neither is implemented in Phase 0; both are out of scope for 0-E.
